    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/bda6532b2fbc6fb53b412a573fcbbe43.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own pond with decorations and bait, then just wait! Weird-looking ugly frogs will show up on their own. Catch them and put them in your bucket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4398be951fa7841df5a825e59b0b567e.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 144 super ugly frogs to collect! Each one looks totally different and hilariously weird. Can you catch all these fat, bouncy, round little weirdos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/e9441931f096179316d11380096a18ad.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your frogs in tanks, feed them, and take care of them until they get nice and chubby. Then sell them for lots of money! Use the cash to buy cool stuff for your pond and tanks, plus more baby frogs. Where do these frogs go when you sell them? Who knows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also shrink the tank to a corner of your desktop, making the ugly frog your companion while you study or work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/5893bd6aa0eee8be122d1ff235127af9.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes huge ugly frogs will attack your pond! Tap the screen like crazy to fight them off! Beat them to get special rewards and unlock rare new frogs. Keep playing to find secret letters that tell you what's really going on with these frog attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/bda6532b2fbc6fb53b412a573fcbbe43.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own pond with decorations and bait, then just wait! Weird-looking ugly frogs will show up on their own. Catch them and put them in your bucket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/b487eee2e07e765dbd5f834cddebf274.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4398be951fa7841df5a825e59b0b567e.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 144 super ugly frogs to collect! Each one looks totally different and hilariously weird. Can you catch all these fat, bouncy, round little weirdos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/4270a32945b7fb0eee63a29de4edbf96.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/e9441931f096179316d11380096a18ad.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your frogs in tanks, feed them, and take care of them until they get nice and chubby. Then sell them for lots of money! Use the cash to buy cool stuff for your pond and tanks, plus more baby frogs. Where do these frogs go when you sell them? Who knows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/f07f57c8b8b2ab55a8ef87bc3e8f6d30.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also shrink the tank to a corner of your desktop, making the ugly frog your companion while you study or work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/cc4e7eaf5b989753f31272207cddd8a4.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/5893bd6aa0eee8be122d1ff235127af9.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes huge ugly frogs will attack your pond! Tap the screen like crazy to fight them off! Beat them to get special rewards and unlock rare new frogs. Keep playing to find secret letters that tell you what's really going on with these frog attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.poster.avif?t=1755519761\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.webm?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330100/extras/dbdab13723e19e7d77d5924a68d4910b.mp4?t=1755519761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The future is chaos - frog attacks everywhere! You're a frog farmer in Potato Pioneer Town, build pond setups to attract different ugly frogs, then snatch them up in your bucket - Yoink! Toss your catches into tanks, fatten them up, and sell for big bucks.",
